{"type":"message","id":"ce1a4034","parentId":"0b878f4b","timestamp":"2026-05-03T19:07:01.837Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sun 2026-05-03 19:06 UTC] Generate a feature image for this article. Title: 'CLARITY Act crypto: 55% chance bill passes after stablecoin yield rules finalized'. Topic: CLARITY Act Stablecoin Regulation. Key Facts: [\"The US CLARITY Act's new stablecoin yield provisions have been finalized and published.\", \"The act prohibits paying interest for solely holding stablecoins but allows rewards for 'bona fide activities'.\"]. Crypto Asset: Stablecoin. Use the Scene Formula in your SOUL.md to pick the right human subject and scene, then run the API calls and logo stamp steps exactly as defined in your SOUL.md."}],"timestamp":1777835221832}}
{"type":"message","id":"fb3958d6","parentId":"ce1a4034","timestamp":"2026-05-03T19:07:10.525Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We need to follow SOUL.md: Pixel generates image via Leonardo AI API. Steps: Craft prompt per scene formula.\n\nArticle about CLARITY Act crypto: stablecoin regulation, yield rules finalized. Scene type: \"Regulation / government ban\" maybe, but it's stablecoin regulation. Could be \"Regulation / government ban\". In that formula: Government official at podium or signing desk, cryptocurrency logos on projected screen behind them. But asset is stablecoin (generic). Must include specific crypto asset visually: Stablecoin. Could be \"stablecoin logo\" on screen. Human subject should be a regulator or lawmaker. So prompt: \"Government official at podium signing bill, projected screen behind showing stablecoin logo and chart, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\". Ensure <300 chars. Also must not include text description of text within image; we shouldn't mention words or numbers. We mention stablecoin logo, but not text.\n\nPrompt length: approx 150.\n\nNow need to execute curl commands with bearer token provided. Must parse generationId, poll up to 3 times.\n\nWe must use exec tool. Sequence: POST generation, capture generationId. Then loop poll. We'll need to parse JSON. Might use jq? Not sure if jq installed. Could use bash and grep. Let's attempt.\n\nWe'll use exec with command sequence that includes steps and final output path. Need to ensure we manage retry if fails.\n\nSimplify by using a bash script that does the steps and echoes the final path or IMAGE_FAILED. Then we can capture output.\n\nWe'll run exec and then read. Use exec tool.\n\nWe need to use /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg path.\n\nLet's craft bash script:\n\n```\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nprompt=\"Government official at podium signing bill, projected screen behind showing stablecoin logo, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\"\nresponse=$(curl -s -X POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations -H \"accept: application/json\" -H \"authorization: Bearer dddd08ff-d8c3-4fec-98d9-9e8c060f4619\" -H \"content-type: application/json\" -d '{\"prompt\":\"'\"$prompt\"'\",\"modelId\":\"b2614463-296c-462a-9586-aafdb8f00e36\",\"num_images\":1,\"width\":1024,\"height\":576}')\ngenId=$(echo \"$response\" | grep -o '\"generationId\":\"[^\"]*' | cut -d'\"' -f4)\nif [ -z \"$genId\" ]; then echo \"IMAGE_FAILED\"; exit 0; fi\nfor i in {1..3}; do\n  sleep 10\n  poll=$(curl -s -X GET \"https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations/$genId\" -H \"authorization: Bearer dddd08ff-d8c3-4fec-98d9-9e8c060f4619\")\n  img=$(echo \"$poll\" | grep -o '\"generated_images\":\\[\"[^\"]*' | cut -d'\"' -f3)\n  if [ -n \"$img\" ]; then\n    curl -L -o /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg \"$img\"\n    break\n  fi\ndone\nif [ ! -s /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg ] || [ $(stat -c%s /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg) -lt 10240 ]; then echo \"IMAGE_FAILED\"; exit 0; fi\nif [ -f ~/.openclaw/assets/logo.png ]; then\n  convert ~/.openclaw/assets/logo.png -resize 150x /tmp/temp_logo.png\n  composite -gravity SouthEast -geometry +20+20 /tmp/temp_logo.png /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg\n  rm -f /tmp/temp_logo.png\nfi\necho \"/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg\"\n```\n\nNeed ImageMagick convert/composite present; assume.\n\nWe need to handle retry if first POST fails: we can attempt second try after 5 seconds with same parameters if genId empty.\n\nSimplify: after first attempt, if genId empty, sleep 5 then repeat POST once. If still empty, output IMAGE_FAILED.\n\nImplement that.\n\nWe'll run exec with this script. Use background? No need. Should run and return final line.\n\nWe'll capture output.\n\nNow call exec.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tooluse_MG3lDLuoOoX6N982JULkWB","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"bash -c '\nprompt=\"Government official at podium signing bill, projected screen behind showing stablecoin logo, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\"\nresponse=$(curl -s -X POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations -H \"accept: application/json\" -H \"authorization: Bearer dddd08ff-d8c3-4fec-98d9-9e8c060f4619\" -H \"content-type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"$prompt\\\",\\\"modelId\\\":\\\"b2614463-296c-462a-9586-aafdb8f00e36\\\",\\\"num_images\\\":1,\\\"width\\\":1024,\\\"height\\\":576}\")\ngenId=$(echo \"$response\" | grep -o '\"generationId\":\"[^\"]*' | cut -d'\"' -f4)\nif [ -z \"$genId\" ]; then\n  sleep 5\n  response=$(curl -s -X POST https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations -H \"accept: application/json\" -H \"authorization: Bearer dddd08ff-d8c3-4fec-98d9-9e8c060f4619\" -H \"content-type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"prompt\\\":\\\"$prompt\\\",\\\"modelId\\\":\\\"b2614463-296c-462a-9586-aafdb8f00e36\\\",\\\"num_images\\\":1,\\\"width\\\":1024,\\\"height\\\":576}\")\n  genId=$(echo \"$response\" | grep -o '\"generationId\":\"[^\"]*' | cut -d'\"' -f4)\nfi\nif [ -z \"$genId\" ]; then echo \"IMAGE_FAILED\"; exit 0; fi\nfor i in 1 2 3; do\n  sleep 10\n  poll=$(curl -s -X GET \"https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations/$genId\" -H \"authorization: Bearer dddd08ff-d8c3-4fec-98d9-9e8c060f4619\")\n  img=$(echo \"$poll\" | grep -o '\"generated_images\":\\[\"[^\"]*' | cut -d'\"' -f3)\n  if [ -n \"$img\" ]; then\n    curl -L -o /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg \"$img\"\n    break\n  fi\ndone\nif [ ! -s /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg ] || [ $(stat -c%s /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg) -lt 10240 ]; then echo \"IMAGE_FAILED\"; exit 0; fi\nif [ -f ~/.openclaw/assets/logo.png ]; then\n  convert ~/.openclaw/assets/logo.png -resize 150x /tmp/temp_logo.png\n  composite -gravity SouthEast -geometry +20+20 /tmp/temp_logo.png /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg /tmp/crypto-feature.jpg\n  rm -f /tmp/temp_logo.png\nfi\necho \"/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg\"' ","timeout":300}}],"api":"bedrock-converse-stream","provider":"amazon-bedrock","model":"openai.gpt-oss-120b-1:0","usage":{"input":10401,"output":1695,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12096,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777835221840}}
